('Selected Short Stories', 'https://rokbucket.rokomari.io/ProductNew20190903/260X372/Selected_Short_Stories-Rabindranath_Tagore-e1a02-339803.jpg', 'Rabindranath Tagore', 'William Collins (India)', 'Foreign Language Books: Story', '9780007925582', 'English', 368, '1st Edition, 2013', 510.0, 510.0, '65%', NULL, 5, 'Pre-Order', 'Tagore''s treatment of caste culture, bureaucracy and poverty paint a vivid portrait of nineteenth century India and all are interwoven with Tagore''s perceptive eye for detail, strong sense of humanity and deep affinity for the natural world. Tagore''s stories continue to rise above geographic and cultural boundaries to capture the imaginations of readers around the world.'),
